1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 14=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,060
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:55,700
(Lin Residence, Pengjian Study)

7
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:58,880
Mother.

8
00:02:04,070 --> 00:02:06,509
Isn't the Xie family coming today?

9
00:02:06,510 --> 00:02:08,239
Why are you dressed so casually?

10
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:10,350
You're not even
wearing any proper jewelry.

11
00:02:10,750 --> 00:02:11,149
Come.

12
00:02:11,150 --> 00:02:12,350
Xiuwan.

13
00:02:13,030 --> 00:02:14,470
Let me help you choose something.

14
00:02:15,150 --> 00:02:16,280
Xiuwan.

15
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,350
This one looks nice.

16
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:31,070
Here.

17
00:02:33,870 --> 00:02:35,000
Xiuwan.

18
00:02:35,910 --> 00:02:39,190
The Xie family isn't coming.

19
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,600
They're not coming today?

20
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:45,029
What day has it been changed to?

21
00:02:45,030 --> 00:02:46,350
Why was it changed?

22
00:02:49,740 --> 00:02:53,460
(Nanxing, Madam Wang's
First-Class Maid)

23
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,959
I don't believe it!

24
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:08,728
I don't believe it!

25
00:03:08,730 --> 00:03:09,880
I don't believe it!

26
00:03:11,030 --> 00:03:12,280
I don't believe it!

27
00:03:12,430 --> 00:03:13,750
I don't believe it!

28
00:03:14,150 --> 00:03:15,440
I don't believe it!

29
00:03:15,750 --> 00:03:18,149
Xie Zhao and my brother
get along so well.

30
00:03:18,150 --> 00:03:19,469
He would never go back

31
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:20,559
on his word over some

32
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,280
baseless rumors.

33
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,600
I don't believe it!

34
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,880
Xie Zhao isn't that kind of person!

35
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,790
I don't believe it.

36
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,680
Xiuwan.

37
00:03:37,750 --> 00:03:39,440
Listen to me.

38
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,750
I know you're upset.

39
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,559
I'll find you

40
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,070
an even better match.

41
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:50,320
Better than the Xie family.

42
00:03:50,856 --> 00:03:52,420
No matter how good anyone else is,

43
00:03:52,430 --> 00:03:53,559
I don't want them.

44
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:55,309
I only want Xie Zhao!

45
00:03:55,310 --> 00:03:56,629
Only Xie Zhao!

46
00:03:56,630 --> 00:03:57,950
All right.

47
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,840
If I'd known this would happen,

48
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:10,400
I never would've invited
the Xie family to the Festival of Man.

49
00:04:10,590 --> 00:04:12,190
Look what it's done to you...

50
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:17,630
What a cruel twist of fate.

51
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,880
What a cruel twist of fate.

52
00:04:22,430 --> 00:04:23,559
Xiuwan.

53
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:24,950
It's all right.

54
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,560
It's all right.

55
00:04:27,870 --> 00:04:29,000
Xiuwan.

56
00:04:30,430 --> 00:04:32,039
Don't frighten me.

57
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,150
Say something.

58
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,070
I'll go find Jinqi.

59
00:04:37,510 --> 00:04:39,680
I'll ask him to speak to Xie Zhao.

60
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:42,070
If this is only
the Xie family's decision,

61
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:44,190
then we can wait a little longer.

62
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:46,700
Once Jinqi clears up the matter,

63
00:04:46,710 --> 00:04:48,990
the Xie family will naturally
discuss the marriage again.

64
00:04:49,016 --> 00:04:49,740
Xiuwan.

65
00:04:49,750 --> 00:04:50,749
Listen to me.

66
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:51,949
Xiuwan.

67
00:04:51,950 --> 00:04:53,150
Xiuwan!

68
00:05:03,310 --> 00:05:04,360
Young Lady.

69
00:05:05,190 --> 00:05:06,119
Young Lady.

70
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,070
Young Lady.

71
00:05:12,070 --> 00:05:13,190
Jinqi.

72
00:05:16,750 --> 00:05:17,429
My brother

73
00:05:17,430 --> 00:05:19,749
is an Assistant Commander
of the Shence Garrison.

74
00:05:19,750 --> 00:05:21,880
What right do you have to arrest him?

75
00:05:23,016 --> 00:05:25,060
If you can't give me
a proper explanation today,

76
00:05:25,070 --> 00:05:26,950
you won't be taking my brother anywhere.

77
00:05:27,220 --> 00:05:29,309
(Yang Chong, Fifth-Rank)
Assistant Commander?

78
00:05:29,310 --> 00:05:31,309
(Judicial Officer of the Central Military Command)
That's all in the past.

79
00:05:31,310 --> 00:05:33,479
Lin Jinqi colluded
with corrupt merchants,

80
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,829
harmed the soldiers,

81
00:05:34,830 --> 00:05:37,559
and forced Lu Dalang
to take his own life.

82
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:40,390
The Five Military Commissions
have ordered his immediate dismissal

83
00:05:40,472 --> 00:05:42,040
and detention pending investigation.

84
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:43,949
Anyone who obstructs official business

85
00:05:43,950 --> 00:05:45,440
will be executed on the spot.

86
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:53,069
My brother would never do such things.

87
00:05:53,070 --> 00:05:54,560
You're falsely accusing him.

88
00:05:55,310 --> 00:05:56,750
This is my second younger sister.

89
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:59,680
Please show
the Lin family some consideration

90
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,800
and allow me a few words with her.

91
00:06:22,310 --> 00:06:24,480
I was only assisting
with the investigation before.

92
00:06:24,750 --> 00:06:25,949
Trust me.

93
00:06:25,950 --> 00:06:27,360
I didn't embezzle anything.

94
00:06:28,750 --> 00:06:30,239
The sooner the truth is uncovered,

95
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:32,070
the sooner my name will be cleared.

96
00:06:34,510 --> 00:06:35,630
Really?

97
00:06:36,310 --> 00:06:37,480
Really.

98
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,680
Jinqi,

99
00:06:43,830 --> 00:06:45,800
you have to keep your word.

100
00:06:45,950 --> 00:06:47,800
You must come back safely.

101
00:06:50,430 --> 00:06:51,750
All these years,

102
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:53,590
when have I ever

103
00:06:53,630 --> 00:06:55,070
broken a promise to you?

104
00:06:55,870 --> 00:06:57,000
All right.

105
00:07:02,950 --> 00:07:04,070
Take him away.

106
00:07:39,950 --> 00:07:41,150
So many people.

107
00:07:41,270 --> 00:07:42,390
Xiuwan.

108
00:07:43,630 --> 00:07:44,949
Don't cry.

109
00:07:44,950 --> 00:07:46,070
It's all right.

110
00:07:46,270 --> 00:07:47,560
Where's Jinqi?

111
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:51,040
Jinqi was arrested.

112
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:54,830
Jinqi was arrested?

113
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:55,869
This...

114
00:07:55,870 --> 00:07:57,070
That wretched boy.

115
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,920
That wretched boy!

116
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,376
I told you long ago,

117
00:08:00,408 --> 00:08:03,150
if he offended the Zhao family
and still wanted to remain an official,

118
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,910
he'd be dismissed
and investigated anyway,

119
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,030
and then thrown into prison.

120
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,176
Now look what's happened.

121
00:08:07,750 --> 00:08:08,919
We don't even know

122
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,040
if he'll make it out alive.

123
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,749
A tall tree catches the wind,

124
00:08:14,750 --> 00:08:18,360
and great fame can bring a man to ruin.

125
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:22,680
Stop making things worse.

126
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,360
This...

127
00:08:25,624 --> 00:08:27,920
- First Madam!
- First Madam!

128
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:28,629
Shunhua!

129
00:08:28,630 --> 00:08:29,239
Shunhua.

130
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:29,919
Check on her.

131
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:30,919
Is she all right?

132
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:32,000
Help us.

133
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,459
Young Lady.

134
00:08:34,460 --> 00:08:36,259
- Is the Lin family finished?
- Look at you, you fool.

135
00:08:36,260 --> 00:08:37,100
Look what you've done.

136
00:08:37,110 --> 00:08:38,099
What are we going to do?

137
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:39,650
What does this have to do with me?

138
00:08:39,670 --> 00:08:42,056
- Go help them. Hurry.
- How is this none of your business?

139
00:08:43,610 --> 00:08:45,600
I don't even want to speak to you.

140
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,430
These are clothes and other necessities

141
00:09:23,448 --> 00:09:24,870
your family asked me to bring you.

142
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,230
Here.

143
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,470
Give them to me.

144
00:09:31,736 --> 00:09:33,272
Your family wanted to visit you,

145
00:09:33,288 --> 00:09:34,488
but Commander Xu gave orders

146
00:09:34,490 --> 00:09:36,280
that no family members
are allowed to visit.

147
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:38,719
Even I had to use
the investigation as an excuse

148
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:39,870
to get in.

149
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,830
What's happening outside?

150
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:45,749
They're saying you colluded
with corrupt merchants and took bribes,

151
00:09:45,750 --> 00:09:48,760
passed off inferior goods as quality
ones, and recklessly endangered lives.

152
00:09:49,464 --> 00:09:50,740
Afraid the truth would come out,

153
00:09:50,750 --> 00:09:53,029
you even led armed men
into a private residence

154
00:09:53,030 --> 00:09:55,239
to kill witnesses and destroy evidence,

155
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:57,560
driving Lu Dalang to his death.

156
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:59,749
I was trying to bring Lu Dalang back

157
00:09:59,750 --> 00:10:00,959
and uncover the truth.

158
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:03,440
But now he's dead, so there's
no one to corroborate your story.

159
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:04,749
Even if I believe you,

160
00:10:04,750 --> 00:10:06,760
the Central Military Command doesn't.

161
00:10:12,750 --> 00:10:14,040
There's something else.

162
00:10:14,510 --> 00:10:16,440
I'm not sure if I should tell you.

163
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:20,070
Can it be any worse than this?

164
00:10:22,550 --> 00:10:24,470
You shouldn't have asked.

165
00:10:24,670 --> 00:10:26,800
That Young Lady Zhao

166
00:10:26,870 --> 00:10:28,470
is engaged again.

167
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:32,800
To the Deputy Chief Censor
of the Censorate.

168
00:10:33,510 --> 00:10:34,830
Dai Rong's father?

169
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:38,470
Have you been cursed
with bad luck or something?

170
00:10:38,616 --> 00:10:40,792
The Censorate serves
as the Emperor's eyes and ears,

171
00:10:40,808 --> 00:10:42,740
keeping watch over
officials and impeaching them.

172
00:10:42,750 --> 00:10:44,959
It was bad enough
that you offended Dai Rong.

173
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:47,280
Now he has someone
whispering in his ear.

174
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:50,264
The Central Military Command has
no choice but to deal with you severely.

175
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:58,239
I'm worried there'll be
more memorials impeaching you.

176
00:10:58,240 --> 00:11:00,079
His Majesty may issue
an edict to punish you.

177
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,119
If that happens,

178
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:03,440
there'll truly
be no room to turn things around.

179
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,350
You've always been quick-witted.

180
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,870
Think of something.

181
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:07,830
I'm off.

182
00:11:07,910 --> 00:11:08,870
Take care.

183
00:11:38,550 --> 00:11:39,760
Xiuwan.

184
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:42,319
The Xie family has already arranged
a marriage for Xie Zhao.

185
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:44,890
It's with the sixth young lady
of the Zhao family's third branch.

186
00:11:45,270 --> 00:11:47,470
You have to give up on him.

187
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,149
Xiuru,

188
00:11:50,150 --> 00:11:51,590
what should we do?

189
00:12:05,150 --> 00:12:06,319
Xiuwan,

190
00:12:06,320 --> 00:12:07,629
don't be upset.

191
00:12:07,630 --> 00:12:09,272
Didn't Old Master say

192
00:12:09,352 --> 00:12:11,352
that as long as Jinqi
conducts himself honorably,

193
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:13,448
he has nothing to fear
from those who wish him ill?

194
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,950
Once the case is cleared up,

195
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:16,950
Jinqi's name will be cleared, too.

196
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:18,869
That's right.

197
00:12:18,870 --> 00:12:20,280
She's right.

198
00:12:20,550 --> 00:12:21,549
Xiuwan,

199
00:12:21,550 --> 00:12:23,040
don't cry.

200
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:26,520
What do you know?

201
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:28,888
I can't be
bothered explaining it to you.

202
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:18,870
(Is that Xie Zhao?)

203
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:22,520
(Why is he here?)

204
00:13:48,910 --> 00:13:51,040
Xiuwan seems to have stopped crying.

205
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,440
She has.

206
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:59,959
I never knew Xiuwan and Jinqi

207
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,760
were so close.

208
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,760
I can't even bring myself to cry.

209
00:14:04,150 --> 00:14:05,950
Xiuru, what about you?

210
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,070
I...

211
00:14:09,150 --> 00:14:10,160
I...

212
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:11,269
I...

213
00:14:11,270 --> 00:14:12,680
I know.

214
00:14:16,150 --> 00:14:18,470
Should we go over?

215
00:14:48,750 --> 00:14:50,029
I found the koi in the pond

216
00:14:50,030 --> 00:14:51,640
and the mandarin ducks so delightful

217
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:53,640
that I became lost in watching them.

218
00:14:53,928 --> 00:14:56,070
I hope I haven't
disturbed you, Young Lady Lin.

219
00:14:58,440 --> 00:15:00,070
This is my favorite spot, too.

220
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:03,870
It's a shame I didn't
bring any pastries today.

221
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:06,509
Otherwise, if you scatter
some crumbs into the pond,

222
00:15:06,510 --> 00:15:08,359
the koi will gather right at your feet.

223
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,680
It's quite a sight.

224
00:15:11,030 --> 00:15:12,520
If I get another chance,

225
00:15:12,630 --> 00:15:15,560
I'll bring something to feed the fish.

226
00:15:17,130 --> 00:15:19,199
♪A faint trace of fragrance♪

227
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:21,159
♪Softly lingers in the air♪

228
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:25,089
♪As the years slowly turn another page♪

229
00:15:25,090 --> 00:15:27,679
♪Your shimmering gaze♪

230
00:15:27,680 --> 00:15:31,930
♪Keeps stirring the tides of fate♪

231
00:15:32,820 --> 00:15:34,819
♪The graceful waves♪

232
00:15:34,820 --> 00:15:36,799
♪Sway gently to and fro♪

233
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:40,770
♪Yet my heart is caught in the flurry♪

234
00:15:41,330 --> 00:15:43,309
♪And you fall into my heart♪

235
00:15:43,310 --> 00:15:48,590
♪There are still many chapters ahead♪

236
00:15:49,130 --> 00:15:51,119
♪I can't forget♪

237
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:53,149
♪My longing fills my eyes♪

238
00:15:53,150 --> 00:15:56,560
♪I long to be with you forever♪

239
00:15:57,040 --> 00:15:59,309
♪Love lingers all around us♪

240
00:15:59,310 --> 00:16:00,549
Xiuwan is smiling.

241
00:16:00,550 --> 00:16:01,999
Zheng must have brought

242
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:03,710
good news about Jinqi.

243
00:16:06,150 --> 00:16:07,760
Who did you say that man was?

244
00:16:08,750 --> 00:16:09,749
Zheng.

245
00:16:09,750 --> 00:16:12,440
Cuique's brother from Luxue Lodge.

246
00:16:12,670 --> 00:16:14,040
The one who saved Jinqi's life.

247
00:16:17,630 --> 00:16:18,830
Are you sure?

248
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,119
I'm sure.

249
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:21,839
When I was in First Madam's room,

250
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:23,959
Zheng came to pay his respects to her.

251
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:26,400
First Madam even
had me greet him properly.

252
00:16:34,270 --> 00:16:34,749
Come on.

253
00:16:34,750 --> 00:16:35,629
Let's go listen too

254
00:16:35,630 --> 00:16:37,280
and see what the good news is.

255
00:16:37,750 --> 00:16:38,800
What are you doing?

256
00:16:39,030 --> 00:16:40,000
Shh.

257
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:41,870
Covering my mouth again?

258
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:43,680
I won't say anything.

259
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:56,040
Why are you

260
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:57,870
suddenly

261
00:16:58,320 --> 00:17:00,040
here in our garden?

262
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:02,870
Did you come to...

263
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:08,630
To see someone?

264
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:14,800
My sister and I
are going to offer incense

265
00:17:15,350 --> 00:17:16,910
and pray for Fengtai's safety.

266
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:18,260
Before leaving the residence,

267
00:17:18,270 --> 00:17:20,560
we were going to pay
our respects to First Madam together.

268
00:17:21,270 --> 00:17:22,670
On the way there,

269
00:17:22,750 --> 00:17:24,952
my sister suddenly realized
she'd forgotten something

270
00:17:25,240 --> 00:17:26,630
and asked me to wait here.

271
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:29,630
Pay your respects to First Madam?

272
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:33,000
Not Second Madam?

273
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:36,000
Zheng.

274
00:17:39,290 --> 00:17:40,390
Xiuwan.

275
00:17:40,510 --> 00:17:42,070
What are you talking about?

276
00:17:42,720 --> 00:17:44,430
While I was enjoying the scenery,

277
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:46,520
I happened to run into Young Lady Lin.

278
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:48,430
We were talking about the view.

279
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:53,670
You're brother and sister?

280
00:17:57,310 --> 00:17:58,800
You are...

281
00:18:00,790 --> 00:18:02,560
This is my brother, Du Zheng.

282
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:03,829
Zheng heard

283
00:18:03,830 --> 00:18:06,150
that Jinqi was taken away
by the Central Military Command

284
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:07,639
and has been very worried about him.

285
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:10,670
He took leave especially
to accompany me to offer incense.

286
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:13,520
You are...

287
00:18:15,070 --> 00:18:16,320
Du Zheng?

288
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:19,320
That's me.

289
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:23,280
Xiuwan,

290
00:18:23,750 --> 00:18:25,350
let's talk again next time.

291
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:26,439
Zheng and I

292
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:27,919
still have to go offer incense

293
00:18:27,920 --> 00:18:29,560
after paying our respects
to First Madam.

294
00:18:32,270 --> 00:18:33,390
Second Young Lady Lin,

295
00:18:34,350 --> 00:18:35,480
I'll take my leave.

296
00:18:50,750 --> 00:18:53,040
He's not Xie Zhao.

297
00:18:55,160 --> 00:18:56,670
He's Du Zheng.

298
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,110
Xiuwan,

299
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:05,999
what news did Zheng bring about Jinqi?

300
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,069
One moment you're happy,

301
00:19:07,070 --> 00:19:08,390
and the next you're troubled.

302
00:19:09,270 --> 00:19:10,350
It's nothing.

303
00:19:12,250 --> 00:19:13,140
You've

304
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:15,040
met him before?

305
00:19:15,790 --> 00:19:17,000
Zheng?

306
00:19:17,590 --> 00:19:18,879
First Madam said Zheng

307
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:21,549
is capable, brave, and kind.

308
00:19:21,550 --> 00:19:23,029
He even saved Jinqi's life.

309
00:19:23,030 --> 00:19:24,549
She told me to respect Zheng

310
00:19:24,550 --> 00:19:26,110
just as I respect Jinqi.

311
00:19:27,400 --> 00:19:30,590
It seems Aunt Shunhua
really likes Zheng.

312
00:19:31,832 --> 00:19:33,740
First Madam
even said she wanted to find

313
00:19:33,750 --> 00:19:35,159
a good match for Zheng.

314
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:37,439
But she worried
that with such a fine young man,

315
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:39,784
she didn't know which young lady
would be a worthy match.

316
00:19:43,240 --> 00:19:44,480
I never expected

317
00:19:44,750 --> 00:19:46,000
such a coincidence.

318
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:48,480
What didn't you expect?

319
00:19:48,750 --> 00:19:49,870
Nothing.

320
00:19:51,350 --> 00:19:52,349
I'm going back.

321
00:19:52,350 --> 00:19:53,720
You two can keep playing.

322
00:20:09,830 --> 00:20:12,040
(Xie Zhao has become Du Zheng.)

323
00:20:12,270 --> 00:20:14,430
(Their family backgrounds
and status are worlds apart.)

324
00:20:15,030 --> 00:20:17,280
(Yet Xiuwan
doesn't seem to care at all.)

325
00:20:17,750 --> 00:20:19,280
(She's simply happy.)

326
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:23,439
Xiuru.

327
00:20:23,440 --> 00:20:25,239
Let's go see Second Sister-in-Law.

328
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:27,280
We can listen
to Jinlan tell stories, too.

329
00:20:30,750 --> 00:20:31,630
All right.

330
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:40,520
Second Young Lady may seem willful,

331
00:20:40,550 --> 00:20:43,870
but I never expected her to be so loyal.

332
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:47,200
The day Young Master was taken away,

333
00:20:47,240 --> 00:20:49,224
I saw how worried
Second Young Lady was...

334
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:55,350
- Yuchan.
- Yuchan.

335
00:20:56,070 --> 00:20:57,430
How's your injury?

336
00:20:58,590 --> 00:20:59,639
It looked serious,

337
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:01,560
but it was only a flesh wound.

338
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:02,879
It's already scabbed over

339
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:04,280
and doesn't hurt at all.

340
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:06,040
That's good.

341
00:21:06,960 --> 00:21:08,560
Come with me to the study.

342
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:10,280
I need to speak with you alone.

343
00:21:17,030 --> 00:21:18,320
Close the door.

344
00:21:33,550 --> 00:21:34,670
This is

345
00:21:34,830 --> 00:21:36,110
Osmanthus cake?

346
00:21:36,750 --> 00:21:38,789
Before Young Master
was taken away, he told me

347
00:21:38,790 --> 00:21:41,280
that he'd sent Jiugao
and Nanke on an errand.

348
00:21:41,310 --> 00:21:42,959
If Jiugao found anything,

349
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:45,320
he'd have someone
send back osmanthus cake.

350
00:21:46,310 --> 00:21:48,430
The cake is a signal.

351
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:58,480
Young Master left a letter.

352
00:21:58,720 --> 00:22:00,320
If the osmanthus cake arrived,

353
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:03,512
I was to deliver the letter to
Marquis Yongchang as soon as possible.

354
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:07,350
Young Master asked me...

355
00:22:08,550 --> 00:22:09,639
Young Master said

356
00:22:09,640 --> 00:22:11,430
this letter would
be difficult to deliver.

357
00:22:11,440 --> 00:22:13,000
I'm loyal,

358
00:22:14,350 --> 00:22:16,040
but I'm not as brave as you.

359
00:22:16,070 --> 00:22:17,719
I'm not as quick-witted as you,

360
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:19,430
or as decisive.

361
00:22:19,496 --> 00:22:21,690
He wanted you to come
with me to deliver the letter.

362
00:22:21,700 --> 00:22:22,999
(Letter from Lin Jinqi)
Make sure

363
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:25,040
the letter reaches
Marquis Yongchang personally.

364
00:22:27,160 --> 00:22:28,480
Young Master said

365
00:22:28,750 --> 00:22:32,280
there'll be a generous reward
if we succeed.

366
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:35,110
What if we fail?

367
00:22:39,960 --> 00:22:42,670
When the nest falls,
no egg remains unbroken.

368
00:22:43,590 --> 00:22:45,480
We're servants of the Lin family.

369
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:47,480
If something happens to Young Master,

370
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:49,520
neither of us will fare well.

371
00:22:56,616 --> 00:22:58,670
They say a marquis's
gates are as deep as the sea.

372
00:22:58,680 --> 00:22:59,959
How can two young maids like us

373
00:22:59,960 --> 00:23:01,910
ever get to see Marquis Yongchang?

374
00:23:13,550 --> 00:23:15,800
Young Master wrote this before he left.

375
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:17,208
He said that many years ago,

376
00:23:17,240 --> 00:23:19,020
when he happened
to meet Marquis Yongchang,

377
00:23:19,030 --> 00:23:21,150
the Marquis casually said these words.

378
00:23:22,200 --> 00:23:24,808
How could Dingyuan remain
[*Dingyuan refers to Ban Chao, who left]

379
00:23:24,810 --> 00:23:27,150
a scholar all his life?
[*the scholar's life for a military career.]

380
00:23:27,160 --> 00:23:29,256
Who under heaven
[*Bohai refers to the poet Gao Shi,]

381
00:23:29,288 --> 00:23:31,800
would not know Bohai?
[*who was known as the Marquis of Bohai.]

382
00:23:32,104 --> 00:23:35,350
I've thought it over again and again,
but I still can't think of a good way.

383
00:23:35,624 --> 00:23:38,350
Now that Young Master has been
dismissed and is under investigation,

384
00:23:38,440 --> 00:23:41,390
the Lin family has no ties
with Marquis Yongchang's household,

385
00:23:41,510 --> 00:23:44,070
and Young Master has never
had dealings with him either.

386
00:23:44,152 --> 00:23:45,768
Even if Master took Young Master's note

387
00:23:45,800 --> 00:23:48,040
to Marquis Yongchang's residence
and asked to see him,

388
00:23:48,110 --> 00:23:50,870
Marquis Yongchang probably
wouldn't receive him.

389
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:54,509
Much less two young maids like us.

390
00:23:54,510 --> 00:23:56,590
Not only do we have
to see Marquis Yongchang,

391
00:23:56,700 --> 00:23:58,380
but we must do it
without alerting anyone.

392
00:23:58,920 --> 00:24:00,150
I have an idea.

393
00:24:00,380 --> 00:24:03,679
(Jiangdong Gate)

394
00:24:03,680 --> 00:24:06,040
Why did we come outside the city?

395
00:24:06,830 --> 00:24:09,069
When Marquis Yongchang leaves
the Xinjiangkou Naval Camp

396
00:24:09,070 --> 00:24:10,509
and returns to his residence,

397
00:24:10,510 --> 00:24:12,749
he'll most likely enter
through Jiangdong Gate,

398
00:24:12,750 --> 00:24:15,110
then pass through Sanshan Gate
into the inner city.

399
00:24:16,070 --> 00:24:16,749
This road

400
00:24:16,750 --> 00:24:19,430
is the only route
from Jiangdong Gate to Sanshan Gate.

401
00:24:19,750 --> 00:24:20,870
But

402
00:24:20,960 --> 00:24:23,000
what if His Lordship
doesn't take this route?

403
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:26,800
We'll have to take that chance.

404
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:31,070
We can only do our best
and leave the rest to fate.

405
00:24:48,460 --> 00:24:54,020
(Jiangdong Gate)

406
00:24:58,100 --> 00:25:04,020
(Yuan Shaohui, Marquis Yongchang,
Commander of the Xinjiangkou Naval Camp)

407
00:25:12,440 --> 00:25:19,309
♪How could Dingyuan
remain a scholar all his life?♪

408
00:25:19,310 --> 00:25:26,910
♪Who under heaven
would not know Bohai?♪

409
00:25:26,960 --> 00:25:33,829
♪How could Dingyuan
remain a scholar all his life?♪

410
00:25:33,830 --> 00:25:41,280
♪Who under heaven
would not know Bohai?♪

411
00:25:51,750 --> 00:25:55,159
We're maids from
the Lin Residence on Yanling Lane.

412
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:55,749
We were...

413
00:25:55,750 --> 00:25:57,560
sent by our master

414
00:25:57,640 --> 00:25:59,630
to deliver a letter to Your Lordship.

415
00:26:04,070 --> 00:26:05,910
Lin Fengtai is imprisoned.

416
00:26:06,310 --> 00:26:08,200
If he has evidence
that can prove his innocence,

417
00:26:08,264 --> 00:26:10,430
he should submit it
to the Central Military Command.

418
00:26:12,550 --> 00:26:14,040
Your Lordship!

419
00:26:14,552 --> 00:26:17,320
If Young Master refuses to submit it
to the Central Military Command,

420
00:26:17,336 --> 00:26:18,800
he must have his reasons.

421
00:26:20,350 --> 00:26:21,430
Your Lordship.

422
00:26:21,880 --> 00:26:23,200
Commander Yuan!

423
00:26:27,384 --> 00:26:29,230
In the sixth year
of the late Emperor's reign,

424
00:26:29,240 --> 00:26:30,910
the Xinjiangkou
Naval Camp was established

425
00:26:30,920 --> 00:26:33,480
with eight thousand naval troops
to oversee the river defenses.

426
00:26:34,160 --> 00:26:36,670
All bandits and illegal salt traders

427
00:26:36,760 --> 00:26:37,896
were to be apprehended,

428
00:26:37,912 --> 00:26:40,152
while the camp also guarded
against Wo pirates.

429
00:26:48,350 --> 00:26:49,670
Commander Yuan,

430
00:26:49,750 --> 00:26:51,928
you are the Commander
of the Xinjiangkou Naval Camp,

431
00:26:51,930 --> 00:26:54,720
not one of the Three Judicial Offices
that investigate wrongful cases.

432
00:26:54,750 --> 00:26:56,879
If Young Master
sent a letter to Commander Yuan,

433
00:26:56,880 --> 00:26:59,390
it naturally wasn't to ask you
to investigate his case.

434
00:26:59,480 --> 00:27:00,520
Then what is it about?

435
00:27:06,310 --> 00:27:07,830
The river defenses.

436
00:27:18,110 --> 00:27:18,910
The letter.

437
00:27:44,750 --> 00:27:45,590
Return to camp.

438
00:27:45,960 --> 00:27:47,520
Take these two maids back with us.

439
00:27:47,750 --> 00:27:49,870
Do not release them without my orders.

440
00:27:50,030 --> 00:27:50,830
- Yes.
- Yes.

441
00:27:57,540 --> 00:27:59,860
(Jiangdong Gate)

442
00:28:01,830 --> 00:28:02,720
- Move.
- Move.

443
00:28:09,030 --> 00:28:10,150
Lanxiang,

444
00:28:10,680 --> 00:28:12,720
did we just make things
worse for Young Master?

445
00:28:13,310 --> 00:28:15,070
We did what Young Master

446
00:28:15,110 --> 00:28:16,670
asked us to do.

447
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:18,760
Really?

448
00:28:24,270 --> 00:28:25,639
You haven't read the letter.

449
00:28:25,640 --> 00:28:27,349
How did you know it was

450
00:28:27,350 --> 00:28:28,870
about the river defenses?

451
00:28:29,440 --> 00:28:30,670
I was bluffing.

452
00:28:33,550 --> 00:28:36,350
But now it seems I was right.

453
00:28:38,510 --> 00:28:40,350
What if you'd guessed wrong

454
00:28:40,510 --> 00:28:43,200
and the letter wasn't
about the river defenses?

455
00:28:44,110 --> 00:28:45,879
Then we'd still end up

456
00:28:45,880 --> 00:28:47,320
being arrested, just like now.

457
00:28:52,260 --> 00:28:53,239
(Longjiang Pass Wharf)

458
00:28:53,240 --> 00:28:54,399
Be careful.

459
00:28:54,400 --> 00:28:55,589
None of this cargo is heavy,

460
00:28:55,590 --> 00:28:56,830
but you still can't be careless.

461
00:29:00,380 --> 00:29:01,639
(Longjiang Pass Wharf)

462
00:29:01,640 --> 00:29:02,870
Set sail.

463
00:29:03,030 --> 00:29:04,589
I'll take you to Taicang,

464
00:29:04,590 --> 00:29:06,264
and then I have
to hurry back to Jinling.

465
00:29:06,920 --> 00:29:08,789
Lin Jinqi forced Lord Fujiwara

466
00:29:08,790 --> 00:29:10,320
to take his own life.

467
00:29:10,480 --> 00:29:12,240
We must avenge him.

468
00:29:13,310 --> 00:29:15,919
I doubt he'll
live long enough to see you.

469
00:29:15,920 --> 00:29:16,959
Once he's convicted,

470
00:29:16,960 --> 00:29:18,159
we'll find a way

471
00:29:18,160 --> 00:29:21,240
to make Lin Jinqi appear to take
his own life in prison out of guilt.

472
00:29:47,590 --> 00:29:49,549
(Ding Peng, Yuan Shaohui's Aide, Assistant Commander)
The Naval Camp is here

473
00:29:49,550 --> 00:29:52,000
to apprehend the Wo pirates!
Kill anyone who resists!

474
00:30:04,110 --> 00:30:05,240
Board the ship!

475
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:53,309
Count everyone!

476
00:30:53,310 --> 00:30:54,670
Take them all away!

477
00:31:28,410 --> 00:31:29,850
My Lord.

478
00:31:32,830 --> 00:31:35,670
- Thank you, My Lord.
- Thank you, My Lord.

479
00:31:35,830 --> 00:31:38,070
Thank you, My Lord.

480
00:31:38,110 --> 00:31:39,959
Thank you
for delivering justice, My Lord.

481
00:31:39,960 --> 00:31:41,349
Thank you, My Lord.

482
00:31:41,350 --> 00:31:42,390
Please, rise.

483
00:31:42,650 --> 00:31:44,100
Thank you, My Lord.

484
00:31:54,296 --> 00:31:56,470
These women are skilled
at spinning and weaving.

485
00:31:56,480 --> 00:31:58,232
The Wo took advantage of their poverty

486
00:31:58,280 --> 00:32:00,560
and their eagerness to earn money
to lure them aboard,

487
00:32:00,570 --> 00:32:02,090
intending to abduct them to Wo country.

488
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:06,280
As for this matter,

489
00:32:06,350 --> 00:32:08,320
I will report the facts to my superiors

490
00:32:08,360 --> 00:32:10,150
and commend Fengtai for his service.

491
00:32:13,800 --> 00:32:16,072
- Thank you, Your Lordship.
- Thank you, Your Lordship.

492
00:32:22,310 --> 00:32:23,200
Young Master.

493
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:41,280
They know they wronged you.

494
00:32:41,350 --> 00:32:43,464
When they heard you were
being released this morning,

495
00:32:43,480 --> 00:32:45,479
they specially took leave
to come and welcome you

496
00:32:45,480 --> 00:32:46,800
and apologize.

497
00:32:53,070 --> 00:32:55,000
Please punish us,
Assistant Commander Lin.

498
00:32:55,064 --> 00:32:58,568
- Please punish us, Assistant Commander Lin.
- Please punish us, Assistant Commander Lin.

499
00:32:58,960 --> 00:33:00,399
Assistant Commander Lin meant well

500
00:33:00,400 --> 00:33:02,280
and tried to secure
better treatment for us,

501
00:33:02,350 --> 00:33:04,479
but we were blinded
by our own foolishness

502
00:33:04,480 --> 00:33:06,430
and mistook a good man for a bad one,

503
00:33:06,480 --> 00:33:09,670
causing Assistant Commander Lin
to suffer such humiliation.

504
00:33:09,720 --> 00:33:12,040
Yet Assistant Commander Lin
bore us no grudge

505
00:33:12,070 --> 00:33:14,549
and went to great lengths
to uncover the true culprit,

506
00:33:14,550 --> 00:33:16,830
so our fallen brothers
can finally rest in peace.

507
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:19,656
We offer our deepest thanks
to Assistant Commander Lin.

508
00:33:19,688 --> 00:33:22,020
- Our deepest thanks, Assistant Commander Lin.
- Our deepest thanks, Assistant Commander Lin.

509
00:33:22,030 --> 00:33:22,679
Get up.

510
00:33:22,680 --> 00:33:23,960
Everyone, get up and speak.

511
00:33:24,070 --> 00:33:25,280
Get up and speak!

512
00:33:25,440 --> 00:33:26,200
Get up.

513
00:33:29,550 --> 00:33:30,870
As your commanding officer,

514
00:33:31,070 --> 00:33:32,829
seeking justice for my men

515
00:33:32,830 --> 00:33:34,320
was always my duty.

516
00:33:34,590 --> 00:33:37,240
I merely did what I should.

517
00:33:37,480 --> 00:33:38,670
As for all of you,

518
00:33:39,030 --> 00:33:41,670
you had the courage to speak up
for your wrongfully killed brothers

519
00:33:41,790 --> 00:33:44,200
and refused to let
the true culprit escape justice.

520
00:33:44,270 --> 00:33:45,760
That is what deserves respect.

521
00:33:46,240 --> 00:33:47,590
We're simple men.

522
00:33:47,750 --> 00:33:49,480
We don't know how to say anything fancy.

523
00:33:49,720 --> 00:33:51,280
But from this day on,

524
00:33:51,350 --> 00:33:54,480
you have our complete respect.

525
00:33:54,552 --> 00:33:57,349
Whatever Assistant Commander Lin
tells us to do, we'll do it.

526
00:33:57,350 --> 00:33:58,269
No questions asked.

527
00:33:58,270 --> 00:33:59,719
We'll follow Assistant Commander Lin.

528
00:33:59,720 --> 00:34:03,160
- We'll follow Assistant Commander Lin.
- We'll follow Assistant Commander Lin.

529
00:34:03,208 --> 00:34:12,870
- We'll follow Assistant Commander Lin.
- We'll follow Assistant Commander Lin.

530
00:34:21,190 --> 00:34:21,919
Young Master.

531
00:34:21,920 --> 00:34:29,180
(Uphold the Family's Honor)

532
00:34:41,710 --> 00:34:43,200
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

533
00:34:55,710 --> 00:34:57,390
Let's wash away Young Master's bad luck,

534
00:34:57,400 --> 00:34:58,990
so everything goes smoothly from now on.

535
00:35:02,744 --> 00:35:04,270
May fortune and prosperity follow.

536
00:35:04,280 --> 00:35:05,589
May everything go smoothly.

537
00:35:05,590 --> 00:35:06,744
Wash away the bad luck.

538
00:35:06,776 --> 00:35:08,700
May fortune
and prosperity follow from now on.

539
00:35:08,710 --> 00:35:10,149
May everything go smoothly.

540
00:35:10,150 --> 00:35:12,709
Nanny Wu, help Jiugao and Nanke
wash away their bad luck, too.

541
00:35:12,710 --> 00:35:13,430
All right.

542
00:35:15,280 --> 00:35:16,320
All right.

543
00:35:19,704 --> 00:35:22,020
May fortune and prosperity follow.
Wash away the bad luck.

544
00:35:22,030 --> 00:35:24,470
Mother, are you washing away
my bad luck or beating your son?

545
00:35:24,488 --> 00:35:26,020
Am I really your own son?

546
00:35:26,030 --> 00:35:28,959
Spare the rod and spoil the child.
Of course I'd beat my own son.

547
00:35:28,960 --> 00:35:30,200
Wash away the bad luck.

548
00:35:34,150 --> 00:35:35,680
I made you worry, Mother.

549
00:35:42,840 --> 00:35:44,320
I'm just glad you're back.

550
00:35:46,480 --> 00:35:48,320
Go change your clothes,

551
00:35:48,440 --> 00:35:51,030
and then pay your respects
to Old Master and Old Madam

552
00:35:51,190 --> 00:35:53,229
so they won't keep worrying about you.

553
00:35:53,230 --> 00:35:54,030
All right.

554
00:35:58,190 --> 00:35:59,149
Your father...

555
00:35:59,150 --> 00:36:01,669
Father and Second Uncle
got into another fight

556
00:36:01,670 --> 00:36:03,799
after arguing over Jinqi's situation.

557
00:36:03,800 --> 00:36:06,800
Old Master ordered them to stay in
the rooms and reflect on their actions.

558
00:36:07,230 --> 00:36:10,240
Later, let Aunt Lingxiao
know you're safe, too.

559
00:36:10,360 --> 00:36:13,640
Thankfully, she's been
keeping me company every day.

560
00:36:14,550 --> 00:36:15,669
What about me?

561
00:36:15,670 --> 00:36:17,350
I've been keeping you company, too.

562
00:36:17,880 --> 00:36:19,390
You've done your part, too.

563
00:36:20,070 --> 00:36:21,640
Tell me what you want later,

564
00:36:21,670 --> 00:36:22,709
and I'll buy it for you.

565
00:36:22,710 --> 00:36:24,879
As long as you're safe

566
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:26,390
and Mother is happy,

567
00:36:26,480 --> 00:36:28,240
I have everything I need.

568
00:36:37,360 --> 00:36:38,470
Mother.

569
00:36:39,510 --> 00:36:41,120
These are tears of joy.

570
00:36:43,960 --> 00:36:45,800
Go change and freshen up.

571
00:36:49,280 --> 00:36:50,390
I'll take my leave.

572
00:36:57,110 --> 00:36:58,030
Mother.

573
00:37:10,840 --> 00:37:12,030
Where are Yuchan and Lanxiang?

574
00:37:12,872 --> 00:37:14,024
Yesterday afternoon,

575
00:37:14,056 --> 00:37:16,072
Yuchan said she was acting
on Young Master's orders

576
00:37:16,104 --> 00:37:17,950
and took Lanxiang out on an errand.

577
00:37:17,960 --> 00:37:19,350
They still haven't returned.

578
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:21,600
Go get Jiugao.

579
00:37:38,360 --> 00:37:39,280
Young Master.

580
00:37:42,400 --> 00:37:43,950
Where did Yuchan and Lanxiang go?

581
00:37:44,190 --> 00:37:44,840
They...

582
00:37:45,360 --> 00:37:46,800
They're still not back?

583
00:37:46,856 --> 00:37:48,870
Marquis Yongchang
was afraid word might get out,

584
00:37:48,960 --> 00:37:50,149
so he had Yuchan and Lanxiang

585
00:37:50,150 --> 00:37:51,600
taken to the Naval Camp.

586
00:37:51,960 --> 00:37:54,280
I thought after we caught
the Wo pirates last night,

587
00:37:54,344 --> 00:37:56,640
Marquis Yongchang would send
someone to bring them back.

588
00:37:57,550 --> 00:37:59,600
Could Marquis Yongchang
have simply forgotten

589
00:37:59,710 --> 00:38:01,830
about Yuchan and Lanxiang?

590
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:03,800
Yuchan has never
been inside a military camp.

591
00:38:03,840 --> 00:38:04,919
Being kept there all night

592
00:38:04,920 --> 00:38:06,390
must have frightened her badly.

593
00:38:06,670 --> 00:38:07,669
No.

594
00:38:07,670 --> 00:38:09,800
I have to go to the Naval Camp
and bring her back.

595
00:38:10,550 --> 00:38:11,430
Stop.

596
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:14,320
I'll go with you.

597
00:38:14,710 --> 00:38:15,709
Young Master.

598
00:38:15,710 --> 00:38:17,669
What about Old Master and Old Madam?

599
00:38:17,670 --> 00:38:20,229
Tell Old Master I have
something urgent to take care of.

600
00:38:20,230 --> 00:38:22,430
I'll pay my respects
and apologize when I return.

601
00:38:25,992 --> 00:38:28,350
So Young Master has business
with Marquis Yongchang.

602
00:38:28,800 --> 00:38:29,910
You gave me quite a fright.

603
00:38:31,710 --> 00:38:33,069
Official business comes first.

604
00:38:33,070 --> 00:38:34,640
Go take care of it, Young Master.

605
00:38:37,110 --> 00:38:41,029
One, two! One, two!

606
00:38:41,030 --> 00:38:43,870
(Naval Camp)
One, two! One!

607
00:38:49,220 --> 00:38:55,300
(Xinjiangkou Naval Camp)

608
00:39:04,030 --> 00:39:05,280
Commander Yuan.

609
00:39:06,120 --> 00:39:07,544
Forgive me for coming unannounced.

610
00:39:07,590 --> 00:39:10,240
First, I came especially
to thank Commander Yuan.

611
00:39:10,480 --> 00:39:11,999
Second, I was hoping to

612
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:14,390
take our two maids home on my way back.

613
00:39:16,344 --> 00:39:17,752
As for what happened this time,

614
00:39:17,800 --> 00:39:19,870
I should be the one
thanking you, Fengtai.

615
00:39:20,320 --> 00:39:21,189
The river defenses

616
00:39:21,190 --> 00:39:23,280
are my responsibility
in the first place.

617
00:39:24,000 --> 00:39:25,709
If the Wo pirates' smuggling ship

618
00:39:25,710 --> 00:39:27,439
had sailed out
of the Sancha River Estuary,

619
00:39:27,440 --> 00:39:29,589
it would have been
much harder to stop them

620
00:39:29,590 --> 00:39:31,176
from sailing downriver and out to sea.

621
00:39:31,710 --> 00:39:33,550
Fortunately, you warned me.

622
00:39:35,110 --> 00:39:36,509
Everything I did

623
00:39:36,510 --> 00:39:38,430
was following Commander Yuan's example.

624
00:39:38,670 --> 00:39:40,839
If Commander Yuan hadn't

625
00:39:40,840 --> 00:39:42,830
said those words
that opened my eyes back then,

626
00:39:42,904 --> 00:39:44,730
there wouldn't be
an Assistant Commander Lin

627
00:39:44,740 --> 00:39:46,984
who gave up the scholar's
path and took up arms today.

628
00:39:49,480 --> 00:39:50,488
I had planned to send

629
00:39:50,520 --> 00:39:52,830
the two young ladies back
first thing this morning.

630
00:39:52,920 --> 00:39:54,709
But too many people objected,

631
00:39:54,710 --> 00:39:56,584
and I couldn't
go against everyone's wishes.

632
00:40:10,030 --> 00:40:14,870
- Good!
- Good!

633
00:40:15,400 --> 00:40:27,680
- Good!
- Good!

634
00:40:30,840 --> 00:40:32,589
That yellow-dappled horse

635
00:40:32,590 --> 00:40:34,680
seemed to sense its master's urgency

636
00:40:35,000 --> 00:40:36,830
to save his benefactor,

637
00:40:36,920 --> 00:40:39,030
and galloped with all its might,

638
00:40:39,190 --> 00:40:41,109
hot breath blasting from its nostrils

639
00:40:41,110 --> 00:40:42,629
and foam spilling from its mouth.

640
00:40:42,630 --> 00:40:44,430
At last, they arrived.

641
00:40:44,920 --> 00:40:46,669
Qin Qiong cried out desperately,

642
00:40:46,670 --> 00:40:49,069
"Stay your blade!"

643
00:40:49,070 --> 00:40:50,509
- Good!
- Good!

644
00:40:50,510 --> 00:40:53,830
- Good!
- Good!

645
00:40:58,030 --> 00:41:01,080
But he was just a moment too late.

646
00:41:01,110 --> 00:41:03,029
The blade came down,

647
00:41:03,030 --> 00:41:04,509
blood sprayed through the air,

648
00:41:04,510 --> 00:41:06,830
and Shan Xiongxin's
head rolled to the ground.

649
00:41:07,230 --> 00:41:10,280
Overcome with grief,
Qin Qiong rushed forward,

650
00:41:10,320 --> 00:41:12,640
but could only gather up Shan Xiongxin's

651
00:41:13,190 --> 00:41:15,760
bloodied head.

652
00:41:22,510 --> 00:41:24,350
The still-warm blood

653
00:41:25,440 --> 00:41:27,600
ran over Qin Qiong's hands,

654
00:41:29,320 --> 00:41:33,030
and memories flooded his mind.

655
00:41:35,150 --> 00:41:36,280
Back then,

656
00:41:37,190 --> 00:41:38,950
he had fallen on hard times in Luzhou

657
00:41:39,440 --> 00:41:41,030
and become gravely ill.

658
00:41:41,510 --> 00:41:42,919
He had no choice but to sell

659
00:41:42,920 --> 00:41:44,830
his beloved yellow-dappled horse.

660
00:41:45,480 --> 00:41:47,600
Shan Xiongxin,
who came to buy the horse,

661
00:41:47,710 --> 00:41:49,830
took to him immediately

662
00:41:50,710 --> 00:41:53,350
and cared for him
devotedly for eight months.

663
00:41:54,510 --> 00:41:56,030
Once Qin Qiong recovered,

664
00:41:56,320 --> 00:41:59,919
he fitted the yellow-dappled horse with
golden stirrups and a silver saddle,

665
00:41:59,920 --> 00:42:03,280
and then gave Qin Qiong Lu silk
and generous funds for his journey.

666
00:42:05,880 --> 00:42:06,990
And now,

667
00:42:07,630 --> 00:42:09,919
Qin Qiong came riding back

668
00:42:09,920 --> 00:42:14,030
on the yellow-dappled horse with
golden stirrups and a silver saddle.

669
00:42:14,920 --> 00:42:16,470
But Shan Xiongxin

670
00:42:19,800 --> 00:42:20,999
was gone.

671
00:42:21,000 --> 00:42:28,479
♪I no longer blame the moon
for withholding its light♪

672
00:42:28,480 --> 00:42:36,020
♪I only pray that those
I've known still live and thrive♪

673
00:42:36,120 --> 00:42:39,799
♪No longer let the world's
wind and snow fall♪

674
00:42:39,800 --> 00:42:49,320
- Good!
- Good!

675
00:42:50,800 --> 00:42:52,240
I came all this way to get you

676
00:42:52,480 --> 00:42:54,390
and missed the best part.

677
00:43:05,020 --> 00:43:08,260
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

678
00:43:14,480 --> 00:43:15,229
I will never

679
00:43:15,230 --> 00:43:16,870
marry an old man.

680
00:43:17,110 --> 00:43:18,589
I'm a person,

681
00:43:18,590 --> 00:43:20,550
not something for my family to show off.

682
00:43:21,440 --> 00:43:23,470
Marquis's wife, Madam Ma, huh?

683
00:43:23,528 --> 00:43:25,200
Whoever wants
those titles can have them.

684
00:43:51,701 --> 00:43:55,821
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

685
00:43:58,661 --> 00:44:03,181
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

686
00:44:04,461 --> 00:44:08,381
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

687
00:44:09,061 --> 00:44:11,821
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

688
00:44:12,541 --> 00:44:14,861
♪Though all the world may fade♪

689
00:44:14,861 --> 00:44:17,941
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

690
00:44:19,461 --> 00:44:23,701
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

691
00:44:26,621 --> 00:44:30,781
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

692
00:44:32,581 --> 00:44:36,141
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

693
00:44:36,141 --> 00:44:39,701
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

694
00:44:40,501 --> 00:44:46,181
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

695
00:44:46,541 --> 00:44:50,861
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

696
00:44:51,221 --> 00:44:54,181
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

697
00:44:54,181 --> 00:44:57,941
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

698
00:44:57,941 --> 00:45:00,821
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

699
00:45:00,821 --> 00:45:04,901
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

700
00:45:04,901 --> 00:45:08,261
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

701
00:45:08,261 --> 00:45:12,021
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

702
00:45:12,021 --> 00:45:16,021
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

703
00:45:16,781 --> 00:45:20,941
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

704
00:45:20,941 --> 00:45:24,381
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

705
00:45:24,381 --> 00:45:28,021
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

706
00:45:28,021 --> 00:45:30,901
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

707
00:45:30,901 --> 00:45:34,981
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

708
00:45:34,981 --> 00:45:38,341
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

709
00:45:38,341 --> 00:45:41,981
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

710
00:45:41,981 --> 00:45:49,781
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

